{"id":"c6c42d8d708f182d","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-composition.md","title":"部分函数的严格复合","display":"df-composition — 部分函数的严格复合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-composition","aliases":["20-df-composition"],"display":"df-composition — 部分函数的严格复合","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 17.2.1(ii)；部分函数版本的本地展开","source_pdf_pages":[256],"source_printed_pages":[229],"depends_on":["[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-composition — 部分函数的严格复合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 17.2.1(ii)；部分函数版本的本地展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>256</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>229</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\omega\">\\(k,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_i:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(g_i:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\omega^m\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(h:\\omega^m\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Comp}(h,(g_i)_{i&lt;m})(\\vec x)\\downarrow=z\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\vec y\\in\\omega^m\\ [(\\forall i&lt;m\\ g_i(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y_i)\\land h(\\vec y)\\downarrow=z].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Comp}(h,(g_i)_{i&lt;m})(\\vec x)\\downarrow=z\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\vec y\\in\\omega^m\\ [(\\forall i&lt;m\\ g_i(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y_i)\\land h(\\vec y)\\downarrow=z].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个中间函数值都必须存在。单值性使复合仍是部分函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 时空元组只有一个，复合为由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(())\">\\(h(())\\)</span> 给出的常数部分函数。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 17.2.1(ii)；部分函数版本的本地展开；印刷页 229；PDF 第 256 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"g_i:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i<m","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\omega^m\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Comp}(h,(g_i)_{i<m})(\\vec x)\\downarrow=z\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\vec y\\in\\omega^m\\ [(\\forall i<m\\ g_i(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y_i)\\land h(\\vec y)\\downarrow=z].","display":true},{"tex":"m=0","display":false},{"tex":"h(())","display":false}],"bytes":1238,"backlinks":[{"id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。"},{"id":"cf6fbe6965e63f34","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-composition]] — 章 17；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-composition]]"}],"outgoing":["3f7915f8f8ad037c"]}